       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.  CNUMITMS.
       DATE-COMPILED.

      ************************************************************
      ** THIS PROGRAM ALLOWS COUNTS THE NUMBER OF ITEMS ON      **
      ** A PURCHASE ORDER.                                      **
      ************************************************************
      *

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DPOITEM-I
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS1002
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                 ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                 WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  DPOITEM-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DPOITEM-REC-I.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS1000  OF MCFLCS1002.

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

       COPY FILESTAT IN COPYLIB.
       COPY DPOITEM  IN COPYLIB.

       LINKAGE SECTION.

       COPY CNUMITMS IN COPYLIB.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION  USING CNUMITMS-PARMS.

       0-MAIN.
           OPEN INPUT DPOITEM-I.
           PERFORM 6-MAIN.
           CLOSE DPOITEM-I.
           GOBACK.

       6-MAIN.
           MOVE 0 TO CNUMITMS-NUM-ITEMS.
           MOVE CNUMITMS-PO-NUMBER TO PORCVNO OF DPOITEM-REC-I.
           START DPOITEM-I KEY >= PORCVNO OF DPOITEM-REC-I
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           READ DPOITEM-I NEXT INTO BUF-DPOITEM
               AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
               PERFORM 6-READ-LOOP UNTIL
                             ITM-PO-RCV-NO NOT = CNUMITMS-PO-NUMBER
                             OR FILE-STATUS > "00".

       6-READ-LOOP.
           IF ITM-PO-RCV-NO = CNUMITMS-PO-NUMBER
               ADD 1 TO CNUMITMS-NUM-ITEMS.
           READ DPOITEM-I NEXT INTO BUF-DPOITEM
               AT END MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.

